            "accordion_text": "<p><strong>The Most Aesthetic Dog Crate. </strong>Your home is a sanctuary for both you and your dog, but their retreat shouldn’t be an eyesore.</p><p>The Koozi Side Table Dog Crate is unlike any other. It gives your dog a cosy, secure den while seamlessly blending into your home’s interiors — with no compromise on style. Whether you’re crate training or simply offering a peaceful retreat, this is a true lifetime investment. It doubles as a sleek side table, providing two essentials in one.</p>",
