            "heading_style": "font-body",
            "accordion_text": "<p></p><p><em>Designed in Sydney Australia</em></p><p><strong>Materials</strong></p><p><strong>Structure</strong>: Elm grain plywood for durability and a natural finish.<br/><strong>Surface top</strong>: White Carrara marble-effect surface top, crafted with lightweight, low-maintenance laminate materials. Designed for modern living, it is heat, scratch, and moisture-resistant, providing a durable and dog-safe foundation.</p><h5><strong>Features</strong></h5><ul><li><strong>Lifetime Value:</strong> Built to last your dog's lifetime, designed to forever fit your home.</li><li><strong>Innovative Transparent Pocket Door:</strong> Allows for flexible use as a dog den or crate for training.</li><li><strong>Sleek Functional Details:</strong> Double gold brass locks and rubber grip feet for added stability and style.</li><li><strong>Built for Small to Medium Dogs:</strong> Compact yet spacious, designed to fit perfectly into modern home interiors.</li><li><strong>Optimised Airflow:</strong> Elongated air holes ensure proper ventilation and comfort for your pet.</li><li><strong>Scratch-Proof Interior:</strong> Interior finish resists scratches, keeping the crate looking pristine.</li><li><strong>Rubber Feet for Grip:</strong> Protects your floors by preventing scratches and ensuring stability.</li><li><strong>Flat-Packed & Simple Assembly:</strong> Easy to assemble with minimal effort, ensuring a hassle-free setup.</li></ul><h5>Details and Care</h5><ul><li><strong>Weight:</strong> Small Size: 24kg | Medium Size: 34kg</li><li><strong>Weight capacity:</strong> 35kg</li><li><strong>Care: </strong>Clean with mild detergent/water and cloth dry</li></ul>",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 8
          }
        },
