    "tabs": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "acordion-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the right size for my dog?",
            "text": "<p>We recommend referring to our size guide at the top of the page, to ensure you choose the right size for your dog. <br/><br/>if you have any questions, reach out to us for personalised guidance at hello@koozipets.com.au.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I assemble the Koozi Crate?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Simple Self Guided Assembly<br/></strong>The Koozi Side Table Dog Crate arrives flat-packed and can be assembled in 15 minutes. Allen key, screws and instruction manual are included, you just need a screwdriver. </p>"
          }
        },
        "d0defd0d-94c3-403c-bd36-dc2f140a104f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and returns",
            "text": "<h4>Warranty Coverage</h4><p>Koozi Pets provides a <strong>12-month limited warranty</strong> covering manufacturing defects only. This warranty applies solely to defects from faulty workmanship.<br/><br/>The warranty period for Side Table Dog Crates purchased from Koozi is one (1) year from the date of purchase. If a replacement Side Table Dog Crate or part is provided, it will inherit the remaining warranty of the original item or one year from the replacement date.</p><p>During the warranty period, Koozi Pets will replace any products or parts of the Side Table Dog Crate that are proven to be defective due to improper material or workmanship, only. Repairs and/or replacements are provided at no charge to you, for eligible warranty claims.<br/><br/>The warranty does <strong>not</strong> cover:</p><ul><li><strong>Damage caused by improper assembly </strong>or not following the instructions when unpacking.</li><li><strong>Normal wear and tear</strong>, including any dog-related use, washing-related wear, weathering, sun-damage or corrosion.</li><li><strong>Damages due to use by pets</strong> (e.g., chewing, bites, rips, burns, excessive scratching, stains, or moisture/liquid damage).</li><li><strong>Damage from improper weight placement</strong> on the Side Table Crate.</li><li><strong>Scars, marks and colour</strong> that are characteristics of natural materials.</li><li><strong>Damage caused by spills </strong>such as acid, solvents, dyes or other corrosive materials, ink, paint, or bodily fluids.</li><li><strong>Commercial use</strong> damage, such as use in hotels or stores.</li></ul><p><br/>To make a claim please read our policy and steps to submit a claim <a href=\"https://koozipets.com.au/pages/warranty-and-returns\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warranty & Returns\">here</a>.</p><h6>Returns and Exchanges Policy</h6><p><strong>We do not offer returns or exchanges</strong> on the Side Table Crate, including for change of mind, as it is a<em> large furniture item</em> and cannot be returned once shipped to you. There is no way of you shipping it back to us.<br/><br/>Before purchasing, please ensure the Side Table Crate meets your dog’s size and has that you have an adequate space in your home to fit it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the benefits of crate training?",
            "text": "<p>Crate training can help dogs feel secure and comfortable by providing a personal, safe space that reduces anxiety and fosters a sense of routine, especially overnight. This practice is particularly beneficial during a puppy's early months and years, supporting their learning and growth, but it also serves as a practical and cherished retreat for dogs of all ages. The Koozi Side Table Crate continues to serve as a dedicated safe den for sleep and relaxation throughout your dog's life.</p><p>With the Koozi Side Table Crate, you can offer this essential comfort without the eyesore of traditional crates. Instead, it serves as a stylish statement piece that enhances your home decor. </p><p>Recognising that crate training is a personal choice that varies based on your dog's needs, our crate features a hidden pocket door system. This innovative design allows it to function as both a cosy den with the door up and a chic side table for your living space.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_fjHtf3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much weight can the tabletop support?",
            "text": "<p>The tabletop surface can hold up to 40kg, making it perfect for flowers, bowls, books, lamps, clocks, photo frames, or other decorative accents.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_9hdUQn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the recommended use guide?",
            "text": "<p>The Koozi Side Table Dog Crate seamlessly combines style and functionality, making it a perfect addition to any room. Use it as a sleek side table beside your sofa or bed, while your dog enjoys it as a cozy den nearby.</p><p>For dogs or puppies new to crates, we recommend a gradual introduction and close monitoring of their behaviour. Do not leave them unattended if they show signs of being destructive; any damage caused by dogs is not covered by warranty.</p><p>We advocate for <strong>responsible</strong> crate training practices. Never leave your dog in the crate with the door closed if they appear distressed, and avoid long, extended periods inside. Remember, dog crates are not designed to be cages; they should provide a safe retreat for your furry friend. For more information and helpful tips, please refer to our recommended crate training guides available on our blog.</p><p>Do not put the crate directly in the sun - this is not good for your dog nor the crate. Find a shady spot in your home.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_yjA4iA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my order ship and is it free?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Enjoy FREE Shipping Australia wide </strong></p><p><strong>Delivery Timeframe</strong><br/>We ship from our warehouse in Sydney, with orders dispatching within 1 to 2 business days.<br/><br/>Delivery timeframe is typically between 4- 14 business days, depending on your location in Australia.</p><p>You will receive an order confirmation email once your order has been dispatched, along with a tracking link to monitor its progress.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_iRM9zw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the Koozi Crate suitable for new puppies?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, the Koozi Side Table Dog Crate is ideal for introducing your puppy to their own dedicated safe and cosy resting space while seamlessly integrating into your living spaces. Its durable design ensures it lasts a lifetime, beautifully complementing your home as your puppy grows.</p><p>The interior is built to withstand light scratching and is waterproof. However, we understand that accidents may happen during the toilet training phase. While our Plush Bed is waterproof and thick enough to protect the crate, we recommend placing a dedicated towel on the base of the crate beneath the bed for added protection of the wooden base. This precaution can help minimise hygiene concerns, staining, and odour issues from any toilet accidents.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_R3ff4V": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does the Koozi Crate have enough ventilation?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, the crate features three rows of elongated air holes on all three sides to provide excellent airflow, keeping your dog comfortable year-round. For added ventilation during warmer months, consider placing a fan nearby or positioning the crate in an air-conditioned space.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_C3yLyd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How durable is the Koozi Crate?",
            "text": "<p>The Koozi crate is designed to stand the test of time. Made with high-quality, dog-safe materials, its scratch-resistant frame and waterproof, stain-resistant finishes ensure durability without compromising style. It’s built to handle daily use and stay looking great for years to come.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_CpK9RK": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "What accessories are compatible with the Koozi Side Table Dog Crate?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Plush Flat Bed:</strong>  Our Plush Flat Bed is designed to fit perfectly into the Koozi Side Table Dog Crate. Available in luxurious linen and boucle fabric covers, its colours and shape complement the minimalist, modern, and organic style of the crate. This thoughtful design ensures that both you and your beloved dog can enjoy your Koozi moments together in comfort and style.</p><p><strong>Sofa Toppers:</strong> The Sofa Topper is a versatile accessory designed to enhance your dog’s comfort in multiple settings. Use it as an additional layer of cosiness inside the Koozi Side Table Dog Crate, or place it on the sofa next to your crate for easy access during cuddle time. You can even drape it over the end of your bed, ensuring that protection and added texture are always within reach. This stylish topper is perfect for moving around and can be used on various soft furnishings, making it a practical and chic addition to your home.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
